    <briefdescription>
<para>Centralized manager for OpenGL graphics resources. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classGraphicsContext" kindref="compound">GraphicsContext</ref> is responsible for creating and managing all OpenGL resources used by the engine: shaders, vertex array objects, vertex buffers, and index buffers. It encapsulates the OpenGL initialization and provides access to these resources.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This class should be initialized after the OpenGL context is created. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classShader" kindref="compound">Shader</ref>, <ref refid="classVertexArray" kindref="compound">VertexArray</ref>, <ref refid="classVertexBuffer" kindref="compound">VertexBuffer</ref>, <ref refid="classIndexBuffer" kindref="compound">IndexBuffer</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
